WEBVTT

00:03.770 --> 00:06.560
Mother, have you ever met a pirate before?

00:06.810 --> 00:09.030
Have you ever crossed the Mediterranean Sea by boat?

00:09.440 --> 00:12.320
Have you ever made anything with a sewing machine?

00:13.200 --> 00:16.240
With all this happening, I've arrived in Spain!

00:26.420 --> 00:27.710
NAAJA

00:26.420 --> 00:27.710
Nadja,

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
With your eyes

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:30.380 --> 00:31.590
Nadja,

00:30.380 --> 00:31.590
NAAJA

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
What do you see?

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
Nani ga mieru

00:33.930 --> 00:36.800
Shining in the far distance,

00:33.930 --> 00:36.800
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:36.800 --> 00:39.180
The door to the future,

00:36.800 --> 00:39.180
Mirai no tobira

00:40.100 --> 00:43.560
That's what I'm searching for

00:40.100 --> 00:43.560
Sagashite iru

00:43.560 --> 00:50.780
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:51.480 --> 00:54.990
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:51.480 --> 00:54.990
Minna egao de aetara

00:55.070 --> 00:58.320
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:55.070 --> 00:58.320
Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:58.370 --> 01:01.580
It could be so much more fun

00:58.370 --> 01:01.580
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

01:01.620 --> 01:05.040
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:01.620 --> 01:05.040
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

01:05.420 --> 01:08.710
I can't see the end of the journey

01:05.420 --> 01:08.710
Tabi no owari wa mienai

01:08.840 --> 01:12.170
God is the only one who could possibly know

01:08.840 --> 01:12.170
Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:12.340 --> 01:15.930
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:12.340 --> 01:15.930
Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:15.970 --> 01:18.090
I will go waving

01:15.970 --> 01:18.090
Te wo furinagara

01:18.180 --> 01:24.850
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:18.180 --> 01:24.850
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:24.890 --> 01:27.600
But I won't look back

01:24.890 --> 01:27.600
Ushiro mukanai

01:27.940 --> 01:32.900
Until the day my dream comes true

01:27.940 --> 01:32.900
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:33.190 --> 01:36.610
Nadja, Your smile

01:33.190 --> 01:36.610
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:36.700 --> 01:40.030
Nadja, gives me courage

01:36.700 --> 01:40.030
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:40.070 --> 01:42.990
Under the blue sky,

01:40.070 --> 01:42.990
Aoi sora no shita de

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
I will find the place

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
Ashita no yukue

01:46.250 --> 01:50.170
where my future lies

01:46.250 --> 01:50.170
Mitsukeru kara

01:55.490 --> 01:57.150
﻿It's pretty hot, isn't it!

01:57.320 --> 02:00.360
﻿Truly! Somehow the sun looks really big from here.

02:01.370 --> 02:04.990
﻿Spain is called the country of the sun and passion.

02:05.620 --> 02:07.330
﻿Barcelona, Spain

02:07.540 --> 02:10.250
﻿flourished as a port city in the Mediterranean Sea.

02:11.880 --> 02:14.380
﻿This large building here is a church, isn't it?

02:14.500 --> 02:15.550
﻿Yeah, that's right.

02:15.760 --> 02:17.880
﻿But it looks like it's still under construction.

02:18.720 --> 02:21.050
﻿I wonder how splendid a church will turn out to be.

02:22.430 --> 02:25.260
﻿As for Barcelona's Sagrada Familia Church,

02:25.560 --> 02:28.930
﻿its architecture was designed by Antonio Gaudi.

02:29.310 --> 02:32.610
﻿Even though a hundred years has passed, it is still incomplete.

02:32.730 --> 02:35.690
﻿Even now, further construction is still taking place.

02:37.240 --> 02:38.900
﻿I'm going shopping!

02:39.990 --> 02:41.200
﻿You don't have to go.

02:41.280 --> 02:42.870
﻿Well then, we're counting on you.

02:43.080 --> 02:44.120
﻿Okay!

02:49.290 --> 02:50.080
﻿Who is it?

02:52.920 --> 02:53.960
﻿A bull?

02:56.710 --> 02:57.420
﻿Nadja!

03:25.030 --> 03:26.490
the... ﻿sun...?

03:27.660 --> 03:28.950
﻿Are you two okay?

03:31.710 --> 03:32.540
﻿You're...

03:33.460 --> 03:34.790
...the Matador, Jose!

03:35.380 --> 03:36.340
﻿It really is Jose!

03:37.460 --> 03:38.050
Eh?

03:38.690 --> 03:49.290
Jose! Jose! Jose! Jose! Jose! Jose! Jose! Jose! Jose!

03:42.930 --> 03:43.680
﻿Nadja?

03:44.090 --> 03:45.260
﻿Are you all right?

03:45.740 --> 03:46.330
Yeah.

03:47.970 --> 03:50.640
﻿Please open up the road for Jose. He's late.

03:55.860 --> 03:56.860
﻿Umm...

04:00.360 --> 04:01.900
﻿Who was that person

04:02.400 --> 04:04.070
﻿You don't know who he is?

04:06.160 --> 04:07.910
﻿You better remember from now on.

04:08.540 --> 04:10.330
﻿He's one of Spain's heroes.

04:10.700 --> 04:13.120
﻿The Matador, Jose Rodriguez.

04:14.960 --> 04:16.130
﻿Matador?

04:21.780 --> 04:26.780
Ole! The Solar Matatador and Flamenco!

04:27.890 --> 04:29.810
﻿So this is a bull fighting arena?

04:30.810 --> 04:34.060
﻿But if I want to thank him for saving me, it would be better if I did it personally...

04:34.060 --> 04:35.520
﻿Heh, now, now.

04:35.730 --> 04:38.610
﻿Thomas, is it okay for you to watch something like a bull fight?

04:38.610 --> 04:39.860
﻿It's perfectly fine.

04:40.610 --> 04:42.070
﻿It'll start soon.

04:42.690 --> 04:45.990
When the sand pit is separated equally into light and shadows,

04:46.070 --> 04:47.780
﻿the bull fight will begin.

04:48.700 --> 04:51.540
﻿Matadors seem very showy to a lot of people.

04:51.870 --> 04:54.000
﻿But really, it's a very dangerous combination.

04:54.410 --> 04:56.790
﻿Life and death. Light and shadow.

04:56.920 --> 04:59.460
﻿Fame and criticism. Passion and despair.

05:00.130 --> 05:04.220
﻿The steadfastness of these men are what make Spain.

05:06.590 --> 05:07.590
﻿It's him!

05:23.610 --> 05:24.940
﻿Toro'! Toro!

05:30.200 --> 05:31.240
﻿Ole!

05:31.240 --> 05:33.450
﻿By doing this, the bull's anger is brought out.

05:33.910 --> 05:35.500
﻿What does "ole" mean?

05:36.000 --> 05:38.960
﻿It's a cry you shout when Matadors give a magnificent performance in the arena.

05:39.880 --> 05:41.040
﻿Ole!

05:42.130 --> 05:44.170
﻿That person is amazing...

05:48.050 --> 05:49.720
﻿Huh? It's over already?

05:50.050 --> 05:52.760
﻿Bull fights are broken up into three acts.

05:53.100 --> 05:55.520
﻿The Matador will appear again at the end.

06:03.020 --> 06:04.320
﻿H-Hey, Thomas...?!

06:37.790 --> 07:07.360
Jose! Jose! Jose! Jose! Jose! Jose! Jose! Jose! Jose!

06:39.350 --> 06:40.770
﻿Amazing...

06:45.900 --> 06:48.110
﻿It really looks like I'll never be able to get close to him.

06:48.530 --> 06:51.910
﻿If he's this popular, he must be making a lot of money.

06:52.070 --> 06:55.580
With fame like that, things like money arid fame to him are easily achievable.

06:55.580 --> 06:59.500
﻿There probably aren't very many people as happy as someone like him.

07:03.670 --> 07:05.920
﻿It's as if he is the sun in human guise...

07:07.960 --> 07:09.300
﻿Toro, toro!

07:10.010 --> 07:11.340
﻿Cre'! Choco'! Toro!

07:12.930 --> 07:14.180
﻿You're being noisy, they say.

07:14.180 --> 07:15.640
﻿Oh, you're just playing?

07:15.930 --> 07:17.430
﻿I'm not playing or anything.

07:17.560 --> 07:20.810
﻿How about putting me as a bull fighter in the main attraction for the performances in Spain?

07:21.770 --> 07:22.980
﻿Are you serious?

07:23.440 --> 07:24.520
﻿I am, I am!

07:24.770 --> 07:26.980
﻿The main attraction ought to be the flamenco, don't you agree?

07:29.690 --> 07:30.990
﻿Leave it to me!

07:31.570 --> 07:34.320
﻿I'll stir up this crowd with the flamenco in tomorrow's performance.

07:34.820 --> 07:36.030
﻿Here you are.

07:36.660 --> 07:37.830
﻿What is that?

07:38.870 --> 07:42.210
﻿There are teachers here, so why don't you formally learn the flamenco?

07:43.170 --> 07:46.840
﻿The flamenco is a little different from the dances you've been dancing up until now.

07:51.570 --> 07:52.320
Here?

07:54.970 --> 07:56.180
﻿Hello.

07:59.430 --> 08:02.600
﻿Umm... Can you tell me where I can find someone named Ms. Anselma?

08:03.940 --> 08:05.690
﻿What do you want with Anselma?

08:06.610 --> 08:07.770
﻿I'd like to give this to-

08:12.150 --> 08:13.490
﻿What do you think you're doing?

08:13.820 --> 08:15.240
﻿That's for Ms. Anselma!

08:15.700 --> 08:17.830
﻿She -is- Anselma.

08:19.540 --> 08:20.410
﻿Dance.

08:23.250 --> 08:25.370
﻿You came here to learn the flamenco, right?

08:25.880 --> 08:27.080
﻿So dance over there.

08:36.930 --> 08:37.890
﻿That's not it.

08:39.510 --> 08:40.350
﻿That's not it!

08:41.310 --> 08:43.680
﻿In Spain, the flamenco comes naturally for everyone.

08:44.310 --> 08:46.850
﻿Everyone has been dancing since childhood.

08:47.480 --> 08:49.770
﻿You won't be able to make much money dancing like that.

08:50.280 --> 08:52.110
﻿Do you really plan to dance like that?

08:53.280 --> 08:55.610
﻿Please tell me what's wrong with the way I dance!

09:10.380 --> 09:11.670
﻿Ms. Anselma!

09:36.610 --> 09:37.780
﻿This is the flamenco.

09:38.360 --> 09:39.160
﻿You got that?

09:40.930 --> 09:41.850
Amazing...

09:43.910 --> 09:45.290
﻿I'm back!

09:46.460 --> 09:47.540
﻿I see.

09:47.540 --> 09:50.670
﻿So I guess having it ready by tomorrow's performance would still be impossible, huh?

09:51.090 --> 09:52.210
Seconds!

09:53.000 --> 09:54.170
﻿I'm sorry...

09:55.010 --> 09:55.960
﻿It's all right.

09:55.970 --> 09:58.590
﻿For the time being, let's think of something else.

09:58.720 --> 10:02.510
﻿What do you think about "Samurai Kennosuke's Lion Show: Bull Fighter Special"?

10:02.600 --> 10:03.680
Rejected!

10:04.680 --> 10:06.890
﻿Why, why? I'm saying that I can do it for sure!

10:05.960 --> 10:06.870
Here, Nadja.

10:07.190 --> 10:08.640
﻿And I'm saying there's no way you can!

10:09.150 --> 10:09.900
﻿Hey, hey!

10:09.980 --> 10:13.110
﻿Eat some paella, and try your best again tomorrow.

10:13.530 --> 10:14.900
﻿Yeah... Thanks!

10:17.070 --> 10:19.530
﻿Jose Rodriguez still hasn't come, has he?

10:20.320 --> 10:22.950
﻿My friend is pressed for time as it is...

10:22.950 --> 10:24.370
﻿So if you're saying that Jose is not here yet...

10:24.700 --> 10:27.120
﻿I believe he will be arriving any moment.

10:27.250 --> 10:29.120
﻿If he comes, let me know right away.

10:29.120 --> 10:30.000
﻿Yes.

10:31.840 --> 10:33.130
﻿Have you found Jose?!

10:33.380 --> 10:34.710
﻿Well, he's nowhere to be found...

10:35.170 --> 10:37.130
﻿Here we are trying to lure in a sponsor,

10:37.170 --> 10:39.340
﻿so where the hell does he go every day?

10:39.680 --> 10:42.970
﻿He's the "hero" and whatnot, so we need him no matter what to get the big bucks!

10:43.050 --> 10:46.350
﻿Fighting with bulls isn't the only job a Matador has, you know!

10:46.520 --> 10:48.310
﻿Even if you tell that to me...

10:49.140 --> 10:51.270
﻿Geez... in any case, look for him!

10:51.600 --> 10:54.230
Even if you have to tie a rope to his neck, bring Jose here!

10:56.530 --> 10:57.480
﻿One more time.

11:03.160 --> 11:04.910
It's ﻿wrong. One more time!

11:09.870 --> 11:10.870
﻿That's not it!

11:18.090 --> 11:19.090
﻿One more time!

11:19.090 --> 11:20.170
Y﻿-Yes!

11:30.770 --> 11:32.980
﻿I think I have all the steps, but...

11:33.480 --> 11:35.150
﻿I wonder what I'm doing wrong?

11:37.940 --> 11:39.440
﻿That guy was the one from before...

11:41.860 --> 11:42.990
﻿Move it, Move it!

11:43.530 --> 11:45.660
﻿Move it, move it!

11:50.660 --> 11:51.750
﻿Watch out!

12:18.400 --> 12:19.650
﻿You fool!

12:21.360 --> 12:22.530
﻿That was dangerous!

12:23.280 --> 12:24.110
﻿Geez...

12:24.660 --> 12:25.610
﻿Are you all right?

12:28.370 --> 12:29.330
﻿You're...!

12:31.450 --> 12:32.500
﻿I'm so sorry.

12:32.750 --> 12:35.500
﻿If people found out it was you, you'd be in trouble, right?

12:36.920 --> 12:37.500
﻿Umm..

12:38.460 --> 12:40.960
﻿Yesterday, you saved me from a dangerous situation.

12:41.630 --> 12:43.220
﻿Ah, do you remember?

12:43.680 --> 12:45.260
﻿It was in front of the Sagrada Familia...

12:45.930 --> 12:46.800
﻿Watch it!

12:48.300 --> 12:49.550
﻿Are you all right?

12:58.610 --> 13:00.020
I ﻿wonder what happened...

13:00.900 --> 13:03.780
﻿In the bull fighting arena, he was shining like the sun, but now...

13:31.180 --> 13:34.560
﻿What should I do? All want to do is thank him...

13:37.770 --> 13:38.770
﻿Umm!

13:41.980 --> 13:43.530
﻿Mr. Jose!

13:45.450 --> 13:48.070
﻿Ex-cuse-me!

13:50.580 --> 13:53.450
﻿Thank you very much for saving me yesterday.

13:55.080 --> 13:56.250
﻿I finally said it.

13:58.620 --> 13:59.170
﻿Umm..

14:00.080 --> 14:01.750
﻿Do you like the flamenco?

14:03.500 --> 14:06.010
﻿Earlier, you were watching from outside of the shop, right?

14:07.180 --> 14:07.880
﻿I hate it.

14:09.800 --> 14:11.470
﻿I hate the flamenco.

14:13.770 --> 14:15.390
I... ﻿see...

14:15.810 --> 14:19.100
﻿Umm... why did you become a bull fighter?

14:24.860 --> 14:26.440
﻿Why do you dance the flamenco?

14:29.570 --> 14:31.700
I﻿'m a dancer for a traveling performance troupe.

14:31.950 --> 14:34.910
﻿I have to dance the flamenco for our performances in Spain.

14:35.500 --> 14:37.950
﻿But no matter how much I practice, I can't do it well.

14:39.790 --> 14:42.290
﻿Somehow, I really don't understand it.

14:51.300 --> 14:52.970
﻿The flamenco is impossible for you.

14:53.640 --> 14:54.180
﻿Eh?

14:56.350 --> 14:57.430
﻿Why?

14:57.980 --> 14:59.480
﻿Why is it impossible for me?!

15:03.520 --> 15:05.610
﻿What's with that person...

15:16.450 --> 15:18.330
﻿You were introduced by Anna Petrova,

15:19.120 --> 15:20.580
﻿so I had high expectations, but...

15:21.830 --> 15:22.830
﻿it turns out to be for the worst.

15:24.250 --> 15:25.170
﻿Go home!

15:26.210 --> 15:27.210
﻿Please wait!

15:29.220 --> 15:31.050
﻿Please tell me what I'm doing wrong!

15:32.220 --> 15:33.800
﻿Even if I told you, it'd be pointless.

15:34.800 --> 15:37.010
﻿The flamenco is impossible for you.

15:50.820 --> 15:53.610
﻿The flamenco is impossible for you.

15:57.450 --> 15:59.700
﻿Why is it impossible for me...?

16:00.540 --> 16:02.750
﻿If there's some sort of flaw,

16:03.040 --> 16:04.460
﻿please let me know somehow.

16:38.620 --> 16:41.450
﻿You know, I used to dance a lot in the orphanage.

16:42.830 --> 16:45.500
﻿Ever since I was little, I loved to dance.

16:46.330 --> 16:49.130
Whenever I danced, I made everyone happy.

16:49.670 --> 16:51.380
﻿That made me really happy.

16:53.300 --> 16:56.130
﻿It's just a coincidence that I became a dancer for a traveling troupe, but...

16:56.390 --> 16:59.890
﻿I used to dance all sorts of dances and made many people happy.

17:00.890 --> 17:01.640
﻿But...

17:03.730 --> 17:06.020
﻿I wonder why my flamenco is so bad?

17:10.020 --> 17:10.820
﻿Those wounds...

17:11.230 --> 17:13.650
﻿They are injuries I sustained from being caught on a bull's horn.

17:14.240 --> 17:16.660
﻿It's not just these. There are wounds all over my body.

17:17.530 --> 17:18.780
﻿They look painful...

17:19.200 --> 17:22.410
﻿There are countless bull fighters that have lost their lives in the middle of a bull fight.

17:23.000 --> 17:24.040
﻿This is nothing in comparison.

17:26.710 --> 17:28.880
﻿Aren't you... afraid?

17:29.670 --> 17:31.630
﻿You conquer your fear of death.

17:32.130 --> 17:33.340
﻿That's what a Matador does.

17:36.340 --> 17:39.010
﻿I dreamt of being a Matador ever since I was a kid.

17:39.640 --> 17:41.260
﻿I didn't think of anything else except that.

17:42.720 --> 17:45.390
﻿Shadows most certainly exist, in places where there's light.

17:46.310 --> 17:47.560
﻿What you're seeing...

17:47.900 --> 17:50.110
﻿...is only the brilliant part that can shine in the light.

17:52.530 --> 17:54.360
﻿The flamenco really is impossible for you.

18:04.410 --> 18:06.910
﻿Nadja's still practicing, isn't she?

18:06.910 --> 18:08.120
﻿She is.

18:08.210 --> 18:09.790
﻿I should have her rest already.

18:09.790 --> 18:12.040
﻿Just let her do as she pleases.

18:12.300 --> 18:13.210
﻿But...

18:13.960 --> 18:16.420
﻿Trying to go beyond your limits is a good thing once in a while.

18:18.380 --> 18:21.260
﻿There are many bull fighters that have lost their lives in a bull fight.

18:26.730 --> 18:28.810
﻿Shadows most certainly exist, in places where there's light.

18:32.230 --> 18:36.070
﻿What you're seeing is only the brilliant part that can shine in the light.

18:49.040 --> 18:51.880
﻿The flamenco really is impossible for you.

19:03.600 --> 19:04.600
﻿Please!

19:06.060 --> 19:08.680
﻿Please watch me dance the flamenco one more time!

19:09.810 --> 19:11.480
﻿Your dance isn't the flamenco.

19:12.150 --> 19:13.650
﻿It's impossible for you.

19:13.860 --> 19:14.650
﻿Go home!

19:14.770 --> 19:16.690
﻿Please, just one more time!

19:18.690 --> 19:19.690
﻿Please!

19:21.780 --> 19:22.820
﻿You know, you're...!

19:22.820 --> 19:24.820
﻿What's the harm, Anselma?

19:25.740 --> 19:29.750
﻿I think I'm right at the point where I'd like to hear her out.

19:31.830 --> 19:33.330
﻿This coming from a drunk.

19:37.630 --> 19:40.300
﻿"Shadows most certainly exist, in places where there's light.”

19:42.300 --> 19:44.300
﻿That's right. I just remembered.

19:46.010 --> 19:50.480
﻿I didn't dance at Applefield Orphanage just to make everyone happy.

19:51.480 --> 19:53.600
﻿Everyone’s sadness and loneliness...

19:53.850 --> 19:55.150
﻿I wanted to help calm them, even if only a little.

19:58.480 --> 19:59.190
﻿That's why...

21:12.930 --> 21:14.140
﻿That's no good.

21:16.480 --> 21:18.690
﻿Your feet dance with no feelings in them whatsoever.

21:18.980 --> 21:20.770
﻿None of it has improved.

21:24.030 --> 21:26.450
﻿But that stuff... I could care less.

21:28.030 --> 21:31.450
﻿For the flamenco, if it's only pretty it's no good.

21:31.700 --> 21:34.540
﻿It's as if the dancer's passion isn't projected, you understand?

21:34.790 --> 21:37.620
﻿A flamenco that doesn't project anything...

21:38.040 --> 21:41.170
﻿...is like cooking paella without the ingredients.

21:43.880 --> 21:45.420
﻿You projected something.

21:46.380 --> 21:48.180
﻿It's still just a little, though.

21:48.970 --> 21:50.760
﻿I guess it's your passion.

21:54.890 --> 21:56.310
﻿Thank you so much!

21:57.980 --> 22:00.650
﻿At this time, the man guiding Nadja,

22:00.980 --> 22:04.610
﻿Jose Rodriguez's door of fate also opened.

22:14.470 --> 22:17.720
Paris is sunnier than London

22:14.470 --> 22:17.720
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

22:17.840 --> 22:20.930
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

22:17.840 --> 22:20.930
CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

22:21.350 --> 22:27.520
The Queen of Spades is a fickle person

22:21.350 --> 22:27.520
SUPEEDO no jou kimagure yasan

22:28.480 --> 22:29.720
Indeed

22:28.480 --> 22:29.720
Kitto

22:32.480 --> 22:34.900
It's not use worrying about it

22:32.480 --> 22:34.900
Nayan datte MUDA yo

22:35.480 --> 22:38.610
Que sera sera, sera Sera

22:35.480 --> 22:38.610
KE SERA SERA SERA SERA

22:38.870 --> 22:43.580
Tomorrow's going to be whatever it was meant

22:38.870 --> 22:43.580
Ashita nante itsumo naru you ni

22:43.660 --> 22:45.040
To be, to be

22:43.660 --> 22:45.040
Naru naru

22:45.370 --> 22:50.380
The tree fog won

22:45.370 --> 22:50.380
Sekai KAERU tobi KONKUURU

22:50.840 --> 22:54.760
The world frog-jumping contest

22:50.840 --> 22:54.760
Yuushou shita yo AMAGAERU

22:57.970 --> 23:04.140
Under the kitten's paw

22:57.970 --> 23:04.140
Koneko chan no ashi no ura wa

23:04.560 --> 23:10.730
Is the scent of the sun, right?

23:04.560 --> 23:10.730
Otentou sama no nioi dane

23:13.570 --> 23:16.900
Paris is sunnier than London

23:13.570 --> 23:16.900
